    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the noise is always there. i try to engage, to just be a normal person, but it's like i'm speaking a language no one else understands. it's exhausting pretending to care about things that don't matter. sometimes i think the only way to actually find that quiet you're talking about is to just... stop trying to fit into something that isn't real.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
